\section{Conclusion}\label{sec:conclusion}

NER exhibits oracle scaling ($c{\approx}0.5$) but aggregation fails above $\theta_{\text{crit}}{=}0.70$.
A hidden-state probe (AUROC $0.63$\textendash$0.88$ vs.\ ESJ $0.51$) reveals a complexity-dependent introspection boundary that entity construction, ensembles, and LP selection ($+0.4$\textendash$1.4$\,pp) bypass rather than resolve.

